# The snapshot input set: everything NOT excluded here is part of the filtered tree a snapshot
# is named by (filtered_tree.py in propensive/.github), so a change to documentation or
# repository metadata alone does not make a new snapshot. Keep `.dockerignore` itself out of
# this list: it defines the set.
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
.claude
.bsp
.bloop
.metals
.vscode
out
dist
doc
**/*.md
LICENSE
target
